### Variables
@host = http://localhost:4000
@userId = 00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001
@contentType = application/json
# Paste a conversation id returned from the "Create conversation" request below.
@conversationId = REPLACE_ME

### Health check
GET {{host}}/health

### Get profile (uses DEFAULT_USER_ID fallback, or the header)
GET {{host}}/api/profile
x-user-id: {{userId}}

### Get preferences
GET {{host}}/api/preferences
x-user-id: {{userId}}

### Get assistant profile
GET {{host}}/api/assistant-profile
x-user-id: {{userId}}

### --- Agent ---

### Chat: simple hello (creates a NEW conversation each time)
# @name helloChat
POST {{host}}/api/agent/chat
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
x-user-id: {{userId}}

{
  "message": "Hello"
}

### Chat: create a task (exercises tool calling)
POST {{host}}/api/agent/chat
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
x-user-id: {{userId}}

{
  "message": "Create a task called Review the sprint plan"
}

### Chat: list tasks via chat
POST {{host}}/api/agent/chat
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
x-user-id: {{userId}}

{
  "message": "What are my tasks for today?"
}

### Chat: remember a preference (exercises memory save)
POST {{host}}/api/agent/chat
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
x-user-id: {{userId}}

{
  "message": "Remember that I prefer concise answers."
}

### Chat: inspect memories conversationally
POST {{host}}/api/agent/chat
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
x-user-id: {{userId}}

{
  "message": "What do you remember about me?"
}

### Chat: uncertain memory (should return a candidate, not save)
POST {{host}}/api/agent/chat
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
x-user-id: {{userId}}

{
  "message": "I might start learning Rust next month."
}

### Chat: reuse conversation (uses @conversationId from variables)
POST {{host}}/api/agent/chat
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
x-user-id: {{userId}}

{
  "message": "What did I just tell you?",
  "conversationId": "{{conversationId}}"
}

### --- Direct resource endpoints ---

### List tasks
GET {{host}}/api/tasks
x-user-id: {{userId}}

### List today's tasks
GET {{host}}/api/tasks?date=today
x-user-id: {{userId}}

### List memories
GET {{host}}/api/memories
x-user-id: {{userId}}

### Search memories
GET {{host}}/api/memories/search?q=concise
x-user-id: {{userId}}

### List goals
GET {{host}}/api/goals
x-user-id: {{userId}}

### List reminders
GET {{host}}/api/reminders
x-user-id: {{userId}}

### Create a goal directly
POST {{host}}/api/goals
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
x-user-id: {{userId}}

{
  "title": "Ship the backend hardening",
  "description": "Land async error handling, rate limiting, and conversations.",
  "category": "CAREER",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### Create a reminder directly
POST {{host}}/api/reminders
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
x-user-id: {{userId}}

{
  "title": "Review the sprint plan",
  "remindAt": "2026-10-09T09:00:00.000Z"
}

### --- Error cases ---

### Malformed JSON body (should return 400 MALFORMED_JSON)
POST {{host}}/api/agent/chat
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
x-user-id: {{userId}}

{not json

### Missing required field (should return 400)
POST {{host}}/api/agent/chat
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
x-user-id: {{userId}}

{}

### Invalid user id header (should return 400)
GET {{host}}/api/profile
x-user-id: not-a-uuid

### Unknown route (should return 404 NOT_FOUND)
GET {{host}}/api/nonexistent
x-user-id: {{userId}}


